      "description": "A sheriff in uniform is standing next to a car and questioning a driver who is seated inside the vehicle. The sheriff appears authoritative, while the driver is gesturing with his hands, possibly in defense or explanation. The scene is set outdoors under a clear sky with mountains in the background.",
